    "display_name": "Typography Challenge",
    "long_instructions": "# Typography Challenge\r\n\r\n**Your Task:** With the help of AI, improve the page's typography so it is consistent.\r\n- Before saving your changes, resize the preview to check how the text looks on smaller screens. If headings become too large or body text becomes hard to read, refine your CSS to improve readability.\r\n\r\n### Plan Before You Prompt\r\n\r\nBefore you ask AI to make changes, write:\r\n- **Goal:** What typography issue are you improving?\r\n- **Constraints:** What must stay consistent with your brand and readability?\r\n- **Edge cases:** What could go wrong if AI overdoes it?\r\n\r\nMake one request at a time (one section, one fix), then preview before asking for the next change.\r\n\r\nThis can include:\r\n- Heading hierarchy (clear difference between title, section heads, subheads)\r\n- Body readability (comfortable size, line height, line length, spacing)\r\n- Emphasis elements (links, quotes, lists, captions)\r\n\r\n:::details [Example AI Style Prompts]\r\nTry having AI update the typography with these example prompts:\r\n- *Style the title to be larger and uppercase. Make it visually distinct from the sub-titles.*\r\n- *Style the body text with 1.5 line height and comfortable max-width.*\r\n- *Improve the blockquote with larger size left border, and italics for emphasis.*\r\n- *Import a legible font family from Google Fonts to my stylesheet. Then, apply this font to [x] elements.*\r\n:::",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Improve the web page's typography so it is consistent.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/d896757c80f2e8a64c1d60168c278ce0-typography.png",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
